    "# Advanced Spectral Clustering with Graph Visualizations\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook provides comprehensive spectral clustering implementation with advanced graph visualizations for methodology analysis.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Features:\n",
    "- Affinity matrix heatmaps\n",
    "- Graph structure visualization (K-nearest neighbor connectivity)\n",
    "- Eigenvalue analysis of Laplacian matrix\n",
    "- Cluster boundary visualization for non-convex shapes\n",
    "- Parameter sensitivity analysis (gamma, neighbors)\n",
    "- Interactive network graphs"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
